abstract: "Five complete Lean formalizations: best-response and aggregate-profile sensitivity, aggregate existence and uniqueness, Nash existence and uniqueness under a contraction condition, and fixed-profile aggregate perturbations. Includes exact-type and axiom audits, pinned reproduction, credits and rejecting controls. Full equilibrium perturbation remains open. Substantial Codex assistance is disclosed; mathematical novelty and human peer review are not claimed."
